lve puzzles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressing through the world will require help, and the creatures of the world not only guide you but, over time, teach you wondrous new abilities that will change the way you explore. Work with them to solve light-hearted but engaging puzzles as you progress through the gorgeous areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/a99c9a2556b14a4200da0f593b5e05c9.poster.avif?t=1788275544\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/a99c9a2556b14a4200da0f593b5e05c9.webm?t=1788275544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/a99c9a2556b14a4200da0f593b5e05c9.mp4?t=1788275544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go for achievements &amp; rewards:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoa 2 features many challenging achievements &amp; ultra-cute costumes for you to collect. Explore the world, discover secrets, and challenge yourself with fun &amp; addictive minigames to unlock these rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/91f2bdaa329b2004c49e05565cc38401.poster.avif?t=1788275544\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/91f2bdaa329b2004c49e05565cc38401.webm?t=1788275544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484770/extras/91f2bdaa329b2004c49e05565cc38401.mp4?t=1788275544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "